{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">亞洲公開花樣滑冰錦標賽，港隊奪得五面銅牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">對上兩屆都有獎牌的李嘉銳，在青年男子組中，以181.21分獲得銅牌，連續三屆上頒獎台。首次出戰的袁萬臻，就在初級少年組，贏得銅牌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.SKATING.HK-0900_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/202649X2HPte4r1785980228.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.SKATING.HK-0900_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">港隊在女子組亦表現出色，郭幸儀在青年組以171.38分摘銅，自2023年起連續四屆奪得獎牌。陳卓瑩、施翊霖分別在高級和初級少年組摘銅。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_JS.SKATING.HK-0900_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026IQn0VB4tjt1785980264.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_JS.SKATING.HK-0900_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T01:58:54.987242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}